{"id":"n15900-1-8","stage":3,"title":"말없이 · 一声不吭地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15900-1-8-1","ko":"어제 어머니께서 말없이 나를 바라보다가 조용히 내 방에서 나가셨어.","zh":"昨天妈妈一言不发地盯着我看了好一会儿，然后悄悄地走出了我的房间。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어머니께서","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말없이","meaning":"一声不吭地","explanation":"말없이：一声不吭地","readings":[{"term":"말없이","audio":"/audio/6ab64a83b941d4f36a64.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15900","senseId":"1","lemma":"말없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바라보다가","meaning":"望，看","explanation":"바라보다：望，看；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"바라보다","audio":"/audio/c09f5b5d3ee043cc11f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64743","senseId":"1","lemma":"바라보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조용히","meaning":"悄悄地","explanation":"조용히：悄悄地","readings":[{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75797","senseId":"6","lemma":"조용히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방에서","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가셨어.","meaning":"出，出去","explanation":"나가다：出，出去；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"1","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"6ab64a83b941d4f3","term":"말없이","zh":"一声不吭地","audio":"/audio/6ab64a83b941d4f36a64.mp3","entryId":"15900","definition":"一句话也不说。","pronunciation":["마ː럽씨"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"c09f5b5d3ee043cc","term":"바라보다","zh":"望，看","audio":"/audio/c09f5b5d3ee043cc11f8.mp3","entryId":"64743","definition":"正对着看。","pronunciation":["바라보다"]},{"id":"ae038c58a1186312","term":"조용히","zh":"悄悄地","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3","entryId":"75797","definition":"不让别人知道而暗地里。","pronunciation":["조용히"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"出，出去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间里移动到外部。","pronunciation":["나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a910f090561faa4b7152.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15900-1-8-2","ko":"언제 한번 어머니와 속 시원하게 대화를 나눠 보렴.","zh":"找个时间，试着和妈妈开诚布公地聊一聊吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"有时间","explanation":"한번：有时间","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"3","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어머니와","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속","meaning":"心，心眼，心地","explanation":"속：心，心眼，心地","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"4","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시원하게","meaning":"爽快，痛快","explanation":"시원하다：爽快，痛快；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"4","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대화를","meaning":"聊天，对话","explanation":"대화：聊天，对话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"대화","audio":"/audio/b3e53098ffdf8c9118d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64562","senseId":"1","lemma":"대화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나눠","meaning":"交流，交换，交谈","explanation":"나누다：交流，交换，交谈；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"6","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보렴.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio